{
  "summary": "10:00 - 11:15: The traveler browsed books and enjoyed coffee, bagels, and conversation with friends at the cozy Shakespeare and Sons bookstore café."
}

{
  "summary": "11:45 AM - 12:35 PM: The traveler browsed books and relaxed with friends in the stylish, cozy environment of Ocelot, not just another bookstore."
}

{
  "summary": "13:00 - 14:10: The traveler and friends enjoyed a relaxed lunch of German comfort food and conversation at Frieda Schlamassel."
}

{
  "summary": "14:45 - 15:30: The traveler visited SAVVY Contemporary, leisurely browsing the bookshop, relaxing with friends while looking through books, and quietly observing the exhibitions."
}

{
  "summary": "16:00 - 18:00: The traveler and friends briefly browsed a comic book store and sampled Japanese snacks before spending most of their time at a nearby brewpub enjoying food, drinks, and relaxed conversation."
}

{
  "summary": "18:30 - 21:00: The traveler and friends enjoyed 150 minutes in a private booth at Monster Ronson's Ichiban Karaoke, singing, relaxing, chatting, and having drinks in a comfortable, low-key setting."
}
